sec.p:
Given this collection of losses, the training process is an optimization problem that repeats the following two steps:
sample xidici∼D, minimize lid+∑jli,jc by updating the parameters of f^dadv and f^ci,jadv, for all j=1,…,K;
sample xidici∼D, minimize li−λ·lid+∑jli,jc by updating the parameters of the encoder f^enc, the decoder f^dec, the perturbation embeddings V^perturbation, the covariate embeddings V^covj for all j=1,…,K, and the dose–response curve estimators f^1…f^M.
